      "readme": "# Myelin Imaging Reliability and ReprOducibility Resource (MIRROR)\n\nMIRROR is a multimodal test-retest MRI dataset of diffusion MRI (dMRI), inhomogeneous magnetization transfer imaging (ihMT), quantitative susceptibility mapping (QSM), MP2RAGE, and T1w/T2w ratio mapping in 22 healthy adults.\n\nThis dataset include derivatives from each of several pipelines used to process individual modalities.\n",
